{"parse": {"title": "旧齿与陈痕-05", "pageid": 89621, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%97%A7%E9%BD%BF%E4%B8%8E%E9%99%88%E7%97%95-04\" title=\"旧齿与陈痕-04\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">旧齿与陈痕-05</span><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%97%A7%E9%BD%BF%E4%B8%8E%E9%99%88%E7%97%95-06\" title=\"旧齿与陈痕-06\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">旧齿与陈痕</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">05</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E7.BE.8E.E9.B2.81.E9.85.9E\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"美鲁酞\">美鲁酞</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 美鲁酞</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">Mellophine</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"></div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"story-text\"><div>叮铃铃——</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-lvguan.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"lvguan\"><img alt=\"lvguan\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/eb/Cg-lvguan.png/600px-Cg-lvguan.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/eb/Cg-lvguan.png/900px-Cg-lvguan.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/eb/Cg-lvguan.png/1200px-Cg-lvguan.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"305301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/da/HeadIconSmall-305301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-305301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"305301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/da/HeadIconSmall-305301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-305301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/da/HeadIconSmall-305301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-305301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">牙仙：</div><div>嗯……您好？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"305301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/da/HeadIconSmall-305301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-305301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"305301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/da/HeadIconSmall-305301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-305301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/da/HeadIconSmall-305301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-305301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">前台：</div><div>亲爱的，您预约的闹钟服务。现在是早上七点三十分，该起床了！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"305313.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d3/HeadIconSmall-305313.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-305313.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"305313.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d3/HeadIconSmall-305313.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-305313.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d3/HeadIconSmall-305313.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-305313.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">牙仙：</div><div>噢！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"305301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/da/HeadIconSmall-305301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-305301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"305301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/da/HeadIconSmall-305301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-305301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/da/HeadIconSmall-305301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-305301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">牙仙：</div><div>该死的噩梦……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"305301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/da/HeadIconSmall-305301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-305301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"305301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/da/HeadIconSmall-305301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-305301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/da/HeadIconSmall-305301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-305301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">牙仙：</div><div>谢谢。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-66haogonglu.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"66haogonglu\"><img alt=\"66haogonglu\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f1/Cg-66haogonglu.png/600px-Cg-66haogonglu.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f1/Cg-66haogonglu.png/900px-Cg-66haogonglu.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f1/Cg-66haogonglu.png/1200px-Cg-66haogonglu.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-chenei.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"chenei\"><img alt=\"chenei\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5e/Cg-chenei.png/600px-Cg-chenei.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5e/Cg-chenei.png/900px-Cg-chenei.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5e/Cg-chenei.png/1200px-Cg-chenei.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">车载广播：</div><div>欢迎来到图森城！今天的天气晴朗……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"305310.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b9/HeadIconSmall-305310.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-305310.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"305310.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b9/HeadIconSmall-305310.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-305310.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b9/HeadIconSmall-305310.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-305310.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">牙仙：</div><div>会议还早着？那太好了教授，我刚停好车……</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-jijinhuidating.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"jijinhuidating\"><img alt=\"jijinhuidating\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b8/Cg-jijinhuidating.png/600px-Cg-jijinhuidating.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b8/Cg-jijinhuidating.png/900px-Cg-jijinhuidating.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b8/Cg-jijinhuidating.png/1200px-Cg-jijinhuidating.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-daxuekeshi.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"daxuekeshi\"><img alt=\"daxuekeshi\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/02/Cg-daxuekeshi.png/600px-Cg-daxuekeshi.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/02/Cg-daxuekeshi.png/900px-Cg-daxuekeshi.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/02/Cg-daxuekeshi.png/1200px-Cg-daxuekeshi.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"612201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d1/HeadIconSmall-612201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-612201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"612201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d1/HeadIconSmall-612201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-612201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d1/HeadIconSmall-612201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-612201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>嘿，孩子，这里！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">牙仙：</div><div>……？哦！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">牙仙：</div><div>埃文教授。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">埃文教授：</div><div>噢！我的孩子！你能来真是太好了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">埃文教授：</div><div>但愿这几天的车程没叫你太过难熬！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">埃文教授：</div><div>阿尔夫把一切都安排妥当了。旅店就在亚利桑那州大学的北面，我保证脚程不超过500米……在第三层，完美的公爵房。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">埃文教授：</div><div>不是我的学生可很难享受这种待遇。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">牙仙：</div><div>非常感谢您。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">牙仙：</div><div>五天确实有些长，但斯巴鲁的好性能救了我一命。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">埃文教授：</div><div>噢，当然，经典车型！谁能不喜欢呢？东西结合的好设计。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">埃文教授：</div><div>必要程度的融合总能焕发出新生命。优点与优点相互靠近……接着，嘣！便能诞生出一些市场认可……性能也极佳的好东西。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">牙仙：</div><div>……实际上，教授，我在停车的时候，见到了桑切斯。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">牙仙：</div><div>我有幸与家父一起参加过一场神秘学界组织的宴会。如果我记忆没有出现偏差，我应该……曾在宴会上见过这位先生。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">牙仙：</div><div>当然，除此之外还有不少面熟的人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">牙仙：</div><div>这与我之前听说的有些出入。您的说辞使我认为，这至少是一场由人类主导的……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">埃文教授：</div><div>哦，你的记性还是这么好……我一直很喜欢你灵光的头脑。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">埃文教授：</div><div>但你瞧，人类并不算少……只是熟面孔多了些！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"305301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/da/HeadIconSmall-305301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-305301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"305301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/da/HeadIconSmall-305301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-305301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/da/HeadIconSmall-305301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-305301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">牙仙：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">埃文教授：</div><div>你的册子拿到了吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"305301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/da/HeadIconSmall-305301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-305301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"305301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/da/HeadIconSmall-305301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-305301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/da/HeadIconSmall-305301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-305301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">牙仙：</div><div>您是指这个？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">埃文教授：</div><div>噢，就是这个！让我看看，在第三页：美鲁酚……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">埃文教授：</div><div>一种强效镇痛，尤其是中重度疼痛的阿类药物。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">埃文教授：</div><div>也是我们这次会议的主角。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">牙仙：</div><div>“从温尼波戈的体内萃取出……”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">牙仙：</div><div>这是……？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">埃文教授：</div><div>哈哈，是不是很熟悉？大学时我们二人的私人课题。说起来还得多谢你的父母。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">埃文教授：</div><div>从那时起，我就已经有针对这个项目的初步构想了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">牙仙：</div><div>阿类药物的管制很严，温尼波戈的修复能力也并不一定对人类适用。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">埃文教授：</div><div>这正是我们要攻克的难点！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">牙仙：</div><div>所以您的意思是……只要将二者合理融合，从理论上来说就能获得一款具有完美的药性的处方药物。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">埃文教授：</div><div>以及一片从未有人涉足的市场。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">埃文教授：</div><div>听着，牙仙……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">牙仙：</div><div>……您叫我什么？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">埃文教授：</div><div>哦，我早就知道这个名字！但我知道，你和“我们”不常用……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">埃文教授：</div><div>听着，我知道你的家庭，我明白你们的志愿，没有事情比生命更重要，我的孩子。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">埃文教授：</div><div>我们是医生，我们最看重的永远是……人们的生命健康。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">埃文教授：</div><div>这就是为什么桑切斯家的那个小子出现在这儿。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">埃文教授：</div><div>因为这是一场需要齐心协力的战争，牙仙。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"305301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/da/HeadIconSmall-305301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-305301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"305301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/da/HeadIconSmall-305301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-305301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/da/HeadIconSmall-305301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-305301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">牙仙：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">埃文教授：</div><div>疾病与疼痛对我们向来一视同仁，死亡也是。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">牙仙：</div><div>教授。您知道，我一直……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">埃文教授：</div><div>噢，当然……在梅奥任职的时候我就一直关注着你，你可是我最得意的学生！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">埃文教授：</div><div>我明白。你有，嗯，那种所谓的……自己的想法，对吧？和坎贝尔家……和你父母的想法有些出入。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">埃文教授：</div><div>但我相信，你父亲与母亲的努力你都看在眼里。坎贝尔家族一直都致力于此。神秘学家与人类是一根同源。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">牙仙：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">埃文教授：</div><div>你是个聪明的孩子……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">广播：</div><div>请来宾尽快入场……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">埃文教授：</div><div>听听看总不会有坏处！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>埃文教授如同往常一样，大力地拍了拍我的肩膀。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">埃文教授：</div><div>来！这边。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-jijinhuidating.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"jijinhuidating\"><img alt=\"jijinhuidating\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b8/Cg-jijinhuidating.png/600px-Cg-jijinhuidating.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b8/Cg-jijinhuidating.png/900px-Cg-jijinhuidating.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b8/Cg-jijinhuidating.png/1200px-Cg-jijinhuidating.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">主持人：</div><div>非常感谢大家的参与！酒会将在校礼堂……</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-daxuezoulang.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"daxuezoulang\"><img alt=\"daxuezoulang\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ab/Cg-daxuezoulang.png/600px-Cg-daxuezoulang.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ab/Cg-daxuezoulang.png/900px-Cg-daxuezoulang.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ab/Cg-daxuezoulang.png/1200px-Cg-daxuezoulang.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-jijinhuizoulang2.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"jijinhuizoulang2\"><img alt=\"jijinhuizoulang2\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b1/Cg-jijinhuizoulang2.png/600px-Cg-jijinhuizoulang2.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b1/Cg-jijinhuizoulang2.png/900px-Cg-jijinhuizoulang2.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b1/Cg-jijinhuizoulang2.png/1200px-Cg-jijinhuizoulang2.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">埃文教授：</div><div>真是振奋人心的发表！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">埃文教授：</div><div>牙仙。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">埃文教授：</div><div>感觉如何？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">牙仙：</div><div>如您所言，如果能保证项目的正常推进，成功通过FDA的审批的话……确实前景难以估量。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">牙仙：</div><div>甚至可以救治数以万计的癌病患者。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">牙仙：</div><div>我会考——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">埃文教授：</div><div>诶，不说那些。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">埃文教授：</div><div>像我说的，咱们就是见个面，吃个饭，聊一些不打紧的东西。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"612201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d1/HeadIconSmall-612201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-612201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"612201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d1/HeadIconSmall-612201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-612201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d1/HeadIconSmall-612201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-612201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">埃文教授：</div><div>以及……瞧瞧这个。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"612201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d1/HeadIconSmall-612201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-612201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"612201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d1/HeadIconSmall-612201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-612201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d1/HeadIconSmall-612201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-612201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">埃文教授：</div><div>成年快乐，牙仙！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>深红色天鹅绒盒子内，静静地躺着一颗罗潘齿。从价值上来说，与我曾见过的那颗有着天壤之别。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>它的釉面光滑精致，大小适中，显然是被精心保养过的优质品。只这小小一颗，便能使约翰家过上半辈子衣食无忧的生活。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">埃文教授：</div><div>来——！拿着它！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">埃文教授：</div><div>我真诚地期望坎贝尔家族能参与到研发中来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">埃文教授：</div><div>研究设备与人员其实已经非常完备了，你只需要……</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"dubaiyongheiping\"><img alt=\"dubaiyongheiping\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/03/Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png/600px-Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/03/Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png/900px-Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/03/Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png/1200px-Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>感到抱歉的是，当时的我并没有集中精神去倾听埃文教授的讲述。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>亚利桑那州大学的会议室仿佛变成了一个马厩，而我正伫立在那个辨不清昼夜的房间里。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>那个不带一丝恶意与偏见的孩子，正和他的母亲在终年不休的滚动砂砾间相互扶持。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"305311.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2f/HeadIconSmall-305311.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-305311.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"305311.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2f/HeadIconSmall-305311.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-305311.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2f/HeadIconSmall-305311.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-305311.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">牙仙：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>在他们那里，我第一次以神秘学家的身份得到了认可。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>这是否是一种命运给予的暗示？不然一切怎能如完美咬合的齿轮，如此流畅地推着我向前？</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-daxuezoulang.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"daxuezoulang\"><img alt=\"daxuezoulang\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ab/Cg-daxuezoulang.png/600px-Cg-daxuezoulang.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ab/Cg-daxuezoulang.png/900px-Cg-daxuezoulang.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ab/Cg-daxuezoulang.png/1200px-Cg-daxuezoulang.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">埃文教授：</div><div>我希望你回去再好好考虑一下，我会等你——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">牙仙：</div><div>不……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">埃文教授：</div><div>抱歉，什么？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">牙仙：</div><div>我想我不需要考虑了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">埃文教授：</div><div>咳，坎贝尔小姐，我希望你……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">牙仙：</div><div>我加入。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">埃文教授：</div><div>什，什么？为……我是说，真的吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">牙仙：</div><div>项目申请我会尽快提交给您，大概会在……明天下午。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>我听到乳牙与智齿在绒布口袋中，摩擦出了喑哑的声响。</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "旧齿与陈痕-05"}}